OL,3,GNEWSAWilson apologises for not
OL,4,Adeclaring Israel debate interest
OL,5,
OL,6,FDUP MP Sammy Wilson has apologised
OL,7,Fafter failing to declare a relevant
OL,8,Finterest when he took part in a House
OL,9,Fof Commons debate on pro-Israel
OL,10,Finfluence in UK politics.
OL,12,FSpeaking in Parliament on Monday,
OL,13,FWilson said he had "inadvertently
OL,14,Ffailed" in the debate on 22 June to
OL,15,Fdeclare that he had visited the country
OL,16,Fon a trip funded by the Israeli
OL,17,Fembassy.
OL,19,FHe was among a number of DUP and other
OL,20,Funionist politicians who made the
OL,21,Fsix-day trip last October.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,419,410,260,120,0,100
