OL,3,GNEWSAWilson apologises for not
OL,4,Adeclaring Israel debate interest
OL,5,
OL,6,FWilson - the MP for East Antrim - said
OL,7,Ffailing to declare the interest was in
OL,8,Fbreach of Parliamentary rules and that
OL,9,Fhe apologised for the error.
